  "Swing and ball flight": "挥杆与球路",
  "Mind and body": "心理与身体",
  "The end": "结束",
  "The movement in pictures": "动作分解图",
  "At the top of \"Library\": \"For you\" – what your rounds show you should practise and the drill of the day – and \"What is your problem?\". Below, the topics by area: short game, long game, swing and ball flight, on the course, mind and body. A topic opens on its shots; the switch at the top (\"‹ Shots ›\") leads to its drills, the basics and the faults.": "“资料库”顶部是“为你推荐”——你的轮次显示你应该练习的内容以及今日练习——还有“你的问题是什么？”。下方是按领域划分的主题：短杆、长打、挥杆与球路、在球场上、心理与身体。打开一个主题时先显示它的击球；顶部的切换（“‹ 击球 ›”）可转到该主题的练习、基础和失误。",
  "Each shot – a standard chip, a chip uphill, a ball plugged in the bunker – has four parts, each with its picture: \"Set-up\" (ball position, stance, weight, club), \"Motion\" (how the stroke goes), \"What to watch\" (what matters, the typical faults) and \"Practise\" (the drills for it). Under the picture of a movement its phases follow as numbered pictures, from the set-up to the finish; the play symbol in the picture plays the drawn movement.": "每个击球——标准切杆、上坡切杆、沙坑里的埋蛋球——都有四个部分，各配一张图：“准备”（球位、站姿、重心、球杆）、“动作”（击球过程）、“注意要点”（关键点、典型失误）和“练习”（相应的练习）。动作图下方以编号图片依次展示它的各个阶段，从准备姿势到收杆；图中的播放图标可播放所绘制的动作。",
  "Yes – at the top of \"Practise\", \"For you\": a plan from your rounds (it takes what cost you most strokes) and plans for your weak spots and your handicap; below, the ready-made plans by the same areas as in \"Library\". \"Weekly plan\" at the top switches to the goal and weekly plans; the green \"+\" builds your own session from the drills you choose. \"Start session\" leads you from drill to drill; a paused session waits on the start page.": "有——在“练习”顶部的“为你推荐”中：根据你的轮次生成的计划（选取让你丢杆最多的环节），以及针对你的弱项和差点的计划；下方是按与“资料库”相同领域分类的现成计划。顶部的“周计划”可切换到目标计划和每周计划；绿色的“+”用你挑选的练习组成你自己的练习。“开始练习”带你逐项完成；暂停的练习会在首页等你。"
}
